					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Come one come all to the Vacation Guild on Tallon Zek.<br />
<br />
Since we can only have one character we will start a vacation guild on Tallos Zek. Its pvp teams.<br />
<br />
Its not as scarry as other pvp server as you can only be attacked or attack someone that is +5 or -5 lvls of yoru own<br />
<br />
Only coins can be looted so keep that cash in the bank<br />
<br />
The guild will be available to anyone who wishes to join being us and our allies.<br />
<br />
When you make your character make sure its a dwarf, gnome, or halfling.  We are the shorty team and are enemies of all the other races.<br />
<br />
Religion doesnt matter so be that gnomish necro if you want<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
Ill leave a message board on for sign ups<br />
<br />
We will be Joining the guild<br />
<br />
Army of Kaladim<br />
<br />
My charcters name is Leafett.
