						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#422">Wield your power</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							All officers have the ability to host a raid. I am not the only one who may do this. <br />
<br />
1. Mention your raid at least 1 week in advance, on the guild message board.<br />
<br />
2. Mention your raid in the Guild MOTD to do this simply type in <br />
<br />
          /guildMOTD &lt;your message&gt;<br />
<br />
3. Keep in mind our younger members.<br />
<br />
4. Hosting a raid doesnt mean you hold it simply to gain something yourself, that is not considered a raid. Such as saying to yourself &quot;Hey i could really use a new sword ill host a raid and get it for myself&quot;<br />
<br />
5. I would like to know about it, no this doesnt mean you need my approval, i will not block your raid.<br />
<br />
6. Consult the other officers, they may have some ideas you could find usefull.<br />
<br />
7. I do not mind doing PL raids since it involes all the guild i dont find this selfish, so it is allowed.<br />
<br />
8. Last and final, remember its your responsibility to let people know, you are an officer of this guild and have the ability to do so, through the means listed above.
						</td>
